  "visibleText": "Gemini Model Comparison Research Plan New chat Conversation with Gemini You said Summarize the difference between Gemini 3 Fast and Gemini 3 Pro models. Keep it concise (~150 words). Use 3 brief sources. Show thinking Gemini said I've put together a research plan. If you need to update it in any way, let me know. Gemini 3 Fast vs. Pro Comparison Research Websites (1) Search for official announcements or technical documentation regarding the release and specifications of Gemini 3 Fast and Gemini 3 Pro models. (2) Identify the core architectural differences, focusing on optimization for speed in the Fast model versus depth of reasoning in the Pro model. (3) Find performance benchmark data comparing the latency, context window capacity, and task accuracy for both models. (4) Look for documentation on the intended use cases, such as real-time chat or high-throughput tasks for Gemini 3 Fast, and complex analysis or creative reasoning for Gemini 3 Pro. (5) Research pricing tiers, API availability, and hardware requirements for deploying or accessing each model variant. (6) Identify three distinct and brief reliable sources that provide a comparison of these models to ensure the summary is well-supported. More Analyze Results Create Report Ready in a few mins Edit plan Start research Try again without Deep Research You're now getting a more personalized experience based on your past chats Deep research Fast Sources Files Gemini is AI and can make mistakes.",
